@startuml system-component
title Quiz Buzzer (課堂搶答系統) - System Components

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft JhengHei"

actor Teacher
actor "Student group" as Student

node "Browser" {
  [Teacher UI] as TUI
  [Student UI] as SUI
}

node "Local server" {
  [API server] as API
  [Real-time channel] as RT
  [Activity service] as ACT
  component "Sheets adapter" as SA {
    [Guided Notes parser] as PARSER
    [Sheets client] as SCLIENT
  }
  database "SQLite store" as DB
}

cloud "Google" {
  [Google Sheets API] as GSA
}

Teacher --> TUI
Student --> SUI

TUI --> API : HTTP (import, preview,\nconfirm, phase changes)
SUI --> API : HTTP (join, submit)
RT ..> TUI : push phase / state
RT ..> SUI : push phase / own group state

API --> ACT : commands
API --> SA : preview requests
ACT --> SA : re-read on confirm
ACT --> DB : atomic transactions
ACT --> RT : publish events
SA --> GSA : read (import)\nwrite (export, later feature)
PARSER ..> SCLIENT : uses cell grid

note right of PARSER
  Locates header (題號 / 作答),
  numbered rows and （k） markers.
  No hardcoded addresses
  (Constitution II).
end note

note bottom of ACT
  Sole authority for activity phase (IV),
  arrival order and winner (I),
  and visibility filtering (III).
end note

note right of SUI
  Student UI and Real-time channel
  are specified by later features.
end note

note left of API
  Teacher actions (import, preview,
  confirm, re-import, phase changes)
  require feature 002's teacher
  passcode check.
end note
@enduml
